.TH ckman-piv-set-chuid 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-piv\-set\-chuid \- Replace CHUID with an unsigned non\-federal identifier (expires 2030\-01\-01)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-piv\-set\-chuid\fR [\fB\-\-guid\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-management\-key\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace CHUID with an unsigned non\-federal identifier (expires 2030\-01\-01)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-guid\fR \fI<GUID>\fR
Cardholder GUID as 32 hex characters (default: a random UUID v4)
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-management\-key\fR \fI<MANAGEMENT_KEY>\fR
Current management key as 48 hex characters (prompted when needed)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
